    "bodyMarkdown": "**[← 返回第11章首頁](ch11-index.md)**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 11.4 核心組件詳細實現\r\n\r\n#### 11.4.1 DAG 調度器實現\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom airflow import DAG\r\nfrom airflow.operators.python_operator import PythonOperator\r\n\r\ndag = DAG(\r\n    'mirror_realm_pipeline',\r\n    default_args={'retries': 3},\r\n    schedule_interval='0 2 * * *'\r\n)\r\n\r\ntask_1 = PythonOperator(\r\n    task_id='data_collection',\r\n    python_callable=collect_data,\r\n    dag=dag\r\n)\r\n\r\ntask_2 = PythonOperator(\r\n    task_id='data_processing',\r\n    python_callable=process_data,\r\n    dag=dag\r\n)\r\n\r\ntask_1 >> task_2\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 11.4.2 資源分配器\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass ResourceAllocator:\r\n    def allocate(self, task, available_resources):\r\n        \"\"\"分配資源給任務\"\"\"\r\n        if task.priority == 'P0':\r\n            return available_resources.cpu, available_resources.memory\r\n        else:\r\n            return available_resources * 0.5\r\n    \r\n    def deallocate(self, task, resources):\r\n        \"\"\"釋放資源\"\"\"\r\n        self.available_resources += resources\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 11.4.3 自動伸縮控制器\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass AutoScaler:\r\n    def scale_up(self, deployment, replicas):\r\n        \"\"\"水平擴展\"\"\"\r\n        deployment.scale(replicas)\r\n    \r\n    def scale_down(self, deployment):\r\n        \"\"\"水平縮減\"\"\"\r\n        deployment.scale(deployment.replicas - 1)\r\n    \r\n    def recommend_resources(self, workload):\r\n        \"\"\"推薦資源配置\"\"\"\r\n        return {\r\n            'cpu': workload.avg_cpu * 1.2,\r\n            'memory': workload.avg_memory * 1.5\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 11.4.4 失敗恢復機制\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass FailureRecovery:\r\n    def retry(self, task, max_retries=3):\r\n        \"\"\"重試失敗的任務\"\"\"\r\n        for i in range(max_retries):\r\n            try:\r\n                task.execute()\r\n                return\r\n            except Exception as e:\r\n                if i < max_retries - 1:\r\n                    time.sleep(2 ** i)\r\n                else:\r\n                    raise\r\n    \r\n    def fallback(self, task, fallback_task):\r\n        \"\"\"執行備用任務\"\"\"\r\n        if task.failed:\r\n            fallback_task.execute()\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 📑 相關章節\r\n\r\n|| 前序 | 當前 | 後續 |\r\n||-----|------|------|\r\n|| [11.3](ch11-3-技術架構.md) | **11.4** | [11.5](ch11-5-資料模型詳細定義.md) |\r\n\r\n**快速鏈接：**\r\n- [← 返回第11章首頁](ch11-index.md)\r\n",
