    "bodyMarkdown": "**[← 返回第11章首頁](ch11-index.md)**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 11.5 資料模型詳細定義\r\n\r\n#### 11.5.1 任務定義模型\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass Task:\r\n    task_id: str\r\n    task_type: str              # dag, cron, trigger\r\n    name: str\r\n    description: str\r\n    dependencies: List[str]\r\n    priority: str               # P0-P3\r\n    resources: ResourceConfig\r\n    retry_policy: RetryPolicy\r\n    timeout: int                # 秒\r\n    status: str                 # pending, running, success, failed\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 11.5.2 資源配置模型\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass ResourceConfig:\r\n    cpu_request: float\r\n    cpu_limit: float\r\n    memory_request: int         # MB\r\n    memory_limit: int\r\n    gpu_count: int\r\n    storage: int                # GB\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 11.5.3 調度事件模型\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass ScheduleEvent:\r\n    task_id: str\r\n    event_type: str             # scheduled, started, completed, failed\r\n    timestamp: int\r\n    status_code: int\r\n    message: str\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 📑 相關章節\r\n\r\n|| 前序 | 當前 | 後續 |\r\n||-----|------|------|\r\n|| [11.4](ch11-4-核心組件詳細實現.md) | **11.5** | [11.6](ch11-6-API詳細規範.md) |\r\n\r\n**快速鏈接：**\r\n- [← 返回第11章首頁](ch11-index.md)\r\n",
