    "bodyMarkdown": "**[← 返回第10章首頁](ch10-index.md)**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 10.3 技術架構\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.1 整體架構\r\n\r\n```\r\n數據源（Kafka）\r\n    ↓\r\nSource Connector\r\n    ↓\r\nFlink Job Manager\r\n    ↓\r\nTask Manager × N\r\n    ↓\r\nWindow Aggregation\r\n    ↓\r\nCEP Engine\r\n    ↓\r\nState Backend (RocksDB)\r\n    ↓\r\nSink Connector\r\n    ↓\r\n目標系統\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.2 流處理管道\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# 基本流處理管道\r\nkafka_source → flatMap → filter → keyBy → window → aggregate → sink\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.3 分層架構\r\n\r\n1. **數據接入層**\r\n   - Kafka Source\r\n   - 消費者配置\r\n   - 分區分配\r\n\r\n2. **流處理層**\r\n   - DataStream API\r\n   - 轉換算子\r\n   - 並行度配置\r\n\r\n3. **狀態層**\r\n   - State Store\r\n   - 檢查點\r\n   - 異步快照\r\n\r\n4. **輸出層**\r\n   - Sink API\r\n   - 多目標寫入\r\n   - 結果驗證\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.4 關鍵組件\r\n\r\n| 組件 | 職責 | 技術 |\r\n|------|------|------|\r\n| JobManager | 協調 | Flink |\r\n| TaskManager | 執行 | Flink |\r\n| State Backend | 狀態 | RocksDB |\r\n| Checkpoint | 備份 | Flink |\r\n| Metric Reporter | 監控 | Prometheus |\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.5 詳細架構圖\r\n\r\n**流處理管道架構：**\r\n\r\n```mermaid\r\ngraph LR\r\n    A[Kafka Source] --> B[FlatMap]\r\n    B --> C[Filter]\r\n    C --> D[KeyBy]\r\n    D --> E[Window]\r\n    E --> F[Aggregate]\r\n    F --> G[ProcessWindow]\r\n    G --> H[Kafka Sink]\r\n    \r\n    E --> I[State Backend]\r\n    I --> J[Checkpoint]\r\n    \r\n    style A fill:#E1F5FF\r\n    style E fill:#FFF4E1\r\n    style F fill:#E8F5E9\r\n    style I fill:#FCE4EC\r\n    style H fill:#F3E5F5\r\n```\r\n\r\n**數據流詳細流程：**\r\n\r\n```mermaid\r\nsequenceDiagram\r\n    participant Kafka as Kafka Topic\r\n    participant Source as Source Operator\r\n    participant Process as Process Operator\r\n    participant Window as Window Operator\r\n    participant State as State Backend\r\n    participant Sink as Sink Operator\r\n    participant Output as Output System\r\n    \r\n    Kafka->>Source: 讀取消息\r\n    Source->>Process: 轉換數據\r\n    Process->>Window: 窗口數據\r\n    Window->>State: 保存狀態\r\n    State-->>Window: 恢復狀態\r\n    Window->>Sink: 聚合結果\r\n    Sink->>Output: 寫入結果\r\n    Sink->>State: Checkpoint\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.6 容錯機制\r\n\r\n**1. Checkpoint 機制**\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom pyflink.datastream import StreamExecutionEnvironment\r\nfrom pyflink.datastream.checkpointing_mode import CheckpointingMode\r\n\r\nclass CheckpointConfig:\r\n    \"\"\"Checkpoint 配置\"\"\"\r\n    \r\n    def configure_checkpoint(self, env: StreamExecutionEnvironment):\r\n        \"\"\"配置 Checkpoint\"\"\"\r\n        # 啟用 Checkpoint\r\n        env.enable_checkpointing(\r\n            interval=60000,  # 60 秒\r\n            mode=CheckpointingMode.EXACTLY_ONCE\r\n        )\r\n        \r\n        # Checkpoint 配置\r\n        checkpoint_config = env.get_checkpoint_config()\r\n        \r\n        # 設置超時時間\r\n        checkpoint_config.set_checkpoint_timeout(600000)  # 10 分鐘\r\n        \r\n        # 設置最小暫停間隔\r\n        checkpoint_config.set_min_pause_between_checkpoints(30000)  # 30 秒\r\n        \r\n        # 設置並發 Checkpoint 數\r\n        checkpoint_config.set_max_concurrent_checkpoints(1)\r\n        \r\n        # 設置外部化 Checkpoint\r\n        checkpoint_config.enable_externalized_checkpoints(\r\n            ExternalizedCheckpointCleanup.RETAIN_ON_CANCELLATION\r\n        )\r\n        \r\n        # 設置 Checkpoint 存儲\r\n        checkpoint_config.set_checkpoint_storage(\r\n            'file:///checkpoints'\r\n        )\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2. Savepoint 機制**\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass SavepointManager:\r\n    \"\"\"Savepoint 管理器\"\"\"\r\n    \r\n    async def create_savepoint(\r\n        self,\r\n        job_id: str,\r\n        savepoint_path: str\r\n    ) -> str:\r\n        \"\"\"創建 Savepoint\"\"\"\r\n        # 觸發 Savepoint\r\n        savepoint_trigger_result = await self.flink_client.trigger_savepoint(\r\n            job_id=job_id,\r\n            savepoint_path=savepoint_path\r\n        )\r\n        \r\n        return savepoint_trigger_result['savepoint_path']\r\n    \r\n    async def restore_from_savepoint(\r\n        self,\r\n        job_jar: str,\r\n        savepoint_path: str\r\n    ):\r\n        \"\"\"從 Savepoint 恢復\"\"\"\r\n        await self.flink_client.submit_job(\r\n            job_jar=job_jar,\r\n            savepoint_path=savepoint_path\r\n        )\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.7 資源管理\r\n\r\n**1. TaskManager 資源配置**\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n# flink-conf.yaml\r\ntaskmanager.numberOfTaskSlots: 4\r\ntaskmanager.memory.process.size: 4096m\r\ntaskmanager.memory.flink.size: 3072m\r\ntaskmanager.memory.managed.fraction: 0.4\r\n\r\n# 網絡緩衝區\r\ntaskmanager.network.memory.fraction: 0.2\r\ntaskmanager.network.memory.min: 512mb\r\ntaskmanager.network.memory.max: 1gb\r\n\r\n# 狀態後端\r\nstate.backend: rocksdb\r\nstate.backend.incremental: true\r\nstate.checkpoints.dir: file:///checkpoints\r\nstate.savepoints.dir: file:///savepoints\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2. JobManager 資源配置**\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n# JobManager 配置\r\njobmanager.memory.process.size: 2048m\r\njobmanager.memory.flink.size: 1536m\r\n\r\n# 高可用配置\r\nhigh-availability: zookeeper\r\nhigh-availability.zookeeper.quorum: zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181\r\nhigh-availability.storageDir: hdfs:///flink/ha\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 10.3.8 監控與指標\r\n\r\n**1. Metrics 收集**\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom pyflink.metrics import Counter, Histogram, Gauge\r\n\r\nclass StreamMetrics:\r\n    \"\"\"流處理指標\"\"\"\r\n    \r\n    def __init__(self, runtime_context):\r\n        self.runtime_context = runtime_context\r\n        \r\n        # 定義指標\r\n        self.records_processed = runtime_context.get_metric_group() \\\r\n            .counter(\"records_processed\")\r\n        \r\n        self.processing_time = runtime_context.get_metric_group() \\\r\n            .histogram(\"processing_time_ms\")\r\n        \r\n        self.backpressure = runtime_context.get_metric_group() \\\r\n            .gauge(\"backpressure\", BackpressureGauge())\r\n    \r\n    def record_processed(self, count: int):\r\n        \"\"\"記錄處理的記錄數\"\"\"\r\n        self.records_processed.inc(count)\r\n    \r\n    def record_processing_time(self, duration_ms: float):\r\n        \"\"\"記錄處理時間\"\"\"\r\n        self.processing_time.update(int(duration_ms))\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2. Prometheus 指標導出**\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n# metrics-reporter 配置\r\nmetrics.reporter.prometheus.class: org.apache.flink.metrics.prometheus.PrometheusReporter\r\nmetrics.reporter.prometheus.port: 9249\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 📑 相關章節\r\n\r\n|| 前序 | 當前 | 後續 |\r\n||-----|------|------|\r\n|| [10.2](ch10-2-詳細功能清單.md) | **10.3** | [10.4](ch10-4-核心組件詳細實現.md) |\r\n\r\n**快速鏈接：**\r\n- [← 返回第10章首頁](ch10-index.md)\r\n",
